  "The inaugural AFTMME conference was launched in 2010 with the aim of bringing together academicians, researchers, practicing engineers, industrialists, and start-up professionals in the fields of mechanical and materials engineering. The conference provides a common platform for sharing ideas, experiences, and recent advancements while fostering collaboration and knowledge exchange. Recognizing the strong synergy between mechanical and materials engineering, AFTMME promotes discussions on emerging trends and innovations in materials and manufacturing for sustainable development. Participants are invited to present their research findings and innovative ideas for a greener future. The conference also features distinguished keynote speakers from academia, research organizations, and industry, offering valuable insights into current challenges and future opportunities.",
