          <h2 class="text-h5 font-bold text-secondary">About Ludhiana</h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-justify text-base-content/90 text-body">
            Ludhiana, often called the Manchester of India, is the largest city in Punjab and one of northern India’s leading industrial centres. Known for textiles, hosiery, manufacturing, entrepreneurship, Punjabi culture, traditional cuisine, and warm hospitality, Ludhiana offers participants a vibrant academic and cultural experience during AFTMME 2026.
          </p>

        </div>

        <!-- Tab 2 -->
